Package: ooarp
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Depends: libc6
Description: ARP CACHE TOOL
 Inspects and flushes neighbor discovery and ARP tables on local network segments.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 MAC address verification, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
